  install-cron [minutes]        Install full-scan + per-minute watch + log rotate crons
  uninstall-cron                Remove LaraWatch cron jobs
  rotate-logs [--force]         Rotate larawatch/cron/watch logs if oversized
  self-update                   Pull latest version from GitHub
  version                       Show version
  help                          Show this help

Config options:
  --telegram-token TOKEN        Telegram bot token
  --telegram-chat CHAT_ID       Telegram chat ID
  --email-to ADDRESS            Email recipient
  --email-smtp HOST             SMTP server hostname
  --email-smtp-port PORT        SMTP port (default: 587)
  --email-smtp-user USER        SMTP username
  --email-smtp-pass PASS        SMTP password
  --repeat-after SECONDS        Re-alert an ongoing finding (0 = alert once)
  --forget-after SECONDS        Forget a finding after it stops appearing (default: 86400)
  --min-severity LEVEL          Minimum severity: CRITICAL, WARNING, INFO
  --scan-dirs DIRS              Space-separated directories to scan
